@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-4" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <p>
        CyberShield is a scam-detection tool built as a personal/portfolio project.
        This page explains, plainly, what happens to the content you submit when you use it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">No accounts, no persistent storage</h2>
    <p>
        CyberShield does not require sign-up or login. Messages, URLs, and files you submit
        for scanning are processed for the purpose of generating a result and are not saved,
        logged, or stored by this application afterward.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">What happens to your data during a scan</h2>
    <p>Depending on which scanner you use, your submitted content is sent to the following third-party services for analysis:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Message Scanner:</strong> the text you submit is sent to Google's Gemini API
            for language analysis, and is subject to
            <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Gemini API terms</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Link Checker:</strong> the URL you submit is sent to Google's Safe Browsing API
            to check it against known threat databases, subject to
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Document &amp; Image Checker:</strong> uploaded files are analyzed
            <strong>locally on this application's server</strong> (metadata inspection and
            compression analysis). They are not sent to any external AI service or third party.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Do not submit sensitive personal documents</h2>
    <p>
        While files are processed locally for the Document Checker and not retained afterward,
        this is a portfolio project, not a production security product with formal audits,
        encryption-at-rest guarantees, or compliance certifications. Please avoid uploading
        real government IDs, financial documents, or other highly sensitive personal information.
        Test files or redacted examples are recommended.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">No tracking or analytics</h2>
    <p>
        This site does not use cookies, analytics scripts, or advertising trackers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Limitations</h2>
    <p>
        CyberShield's results are heuristic and AI-assisted assessments, not guarantees.
        A "Green" result does not certify something is safe, and a "Red" result does not
        constitute legal or professional confirmation of fraud. Always use independent
        judgment, especially for high-stakes decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Contact</h2>
    <p>
        This is an independent project. For questions, see the project's
        <a href="https://github.com/bokangngoetjana/CyberShield" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository</a>.
    </p>
</div>
